{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/about.png?t=1743478207\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TinyCraft Town invites you to build and manage a flourishing village. Hone your resource management skills, develop a thriving economy, and enjoy a calming experience as you expand your settlement and produce valuable resources more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan your production chain, gather materials, and construct new buildings to expand your village. Trade with locals, unlock new crafting recipes, and optimize your resource flow to ensure prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/TCT_Village_Evolution.gif?t=1743478207\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/features.png?t=1743478207\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Build &amp; Craft</strong> \u2013 <strong>Chop trees, mine ores, and construct buildings</strong> to restore the town.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf3f Explore &amp; Expand</strong> \u2013 Discover new land, unlock crafting recipes, and optimize your village\u2019s growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udce6 Strategic Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Gather materials and balance production to keep the economy thriving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Beautiful Pixel Art &amp; Relaxing Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 A cozy world to immerse yourself in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd04 Ongoing Content Updates</strong> \u2013 New content and expansions keep the experience fresh.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the Village!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/2402c03541935eb1683bdda423d07e80d4654a4a.jpg"},{"name":"Getting to Work!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/d06e4e5b6a7602cc57079bac969726a9b3a38cc3.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Blacksmith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/69ac02444987a20d564467ae3672246a0d344988.jpg"},{"name":"Town Expansion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/95f3390ef6bf23a8832894c225389dfa58d318e6.jpg"},{"name":"Riches of the Earth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/f537d68d9263db4998c097c1bc55c4006e68d63f.jpg"},{"name":"Master Craftsman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/fbb9e38eecfecd2b4d64b847f43d6116737140e8.jpg"},{"name":"Coin Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/7e7864b9bad423950fad60cb55311ceb444b889c.jpg"},{"name":"Small Fortune","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/a35f0c00e2827956fd4f223c6194044c23d617ee.jpg"},{"name":"Wealthy Merchant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/302aba5d58ad7582e7519cba92ea74298a5aa831.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Tycoon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/14abe67e4f5a97ec2c7f42cbcc48193a46c8a06a.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3314780?t=1743478207","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/6ebd069d04059fb24bc927081a69f37c851dbdb3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743478207","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app